## 📊 Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)

The project evaluates logistics performance using the following metrics:

| KPI | Description |
|---|---|
| Total Orders | Total number of unique non-cancelled orders |
| Average Shipping Days | Average time taken for shipping |
| On-Time Delivery Rate | Percentage of orders delivered on time or early |
| Delayed Delivery Rate | Percentage of orders delivered late |
| Average Delay Days | Average delay duration for late orders |

